{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/extras/636f12ee16d225ae4e342506b6a66c28.avif?t=1760291840\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out On The Water is a short, meditative journey through memory and grief that tells the story of an inattentive father and his last chance to connect with his children. In this Demo, experience one of the child's stories by catching special memory fish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/extras/8e0f93a0249b0778fcf05b37f7476f29.avif?t=1760291840\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 1 of 3 poignant stories in the Demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover some of the memory fish with more featured in the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A memory journal reveals one of the children's memories, as well as chronicles some of the fish you catch\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short 10-15 minute playthrough, that will give an idea of what the full game experience will be like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fishing mechanic where you must manage your stamina in order to catch fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/extras/414af4e362e589abf13ce90469aafb87.avif?t=1760291840\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to say thank you for checking out my game demo. Night Pond Games is a solo indie developer studio dedicated to making small games that mix deeply moving, emotional storytelling with interesting gameplay that features unique mechanics and environments. I enjoy playing these types games, and I hope I made a game you enjoy playing as well.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808360?t=1760291840","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808360?t=1760291840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/35e8e60892671ea27d4fd528c88ce9e7987e22bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760291840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/35e8e60892671ea27d4fd528c88ce9e7987e22bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760291840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Out on the Water features a fictionalized setting of the afterlife."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/extras/636f12ee16d225ae4e342506b6a66c28.avif?t=1760291840\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out On The Water is a short, meditative journey through memory and grief that tells the story of an inattentive father and his last chance to connect with his children. In this Demo, experience one of the child's stories by catching special memory fish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/extras/8e0f93a0249b0778fcf05b37f7476f29.avif?t=1760291840\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 1 of 3 poignant stories in the Demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover some of the memory fish with more featured in the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A memory journal reveals one of the children's memories, as well as chronicles some of the fish you catch\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short 10-15 minute playthrough, that will give an idea of what the full game experience will be like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fishing mechanic where you must manage your stamina in order to catch fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/extras/414af4e362e589abf13ce90469aafb87.avif?t=1760291840\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to say thank you for checking out my game demo. Night Pond Games is a solo indie developer studio dedicated to making small games that mix deeply moving, emotional storytelling with interesting gameplay that features unique mechanics and environments. I enjoy playing these types games, and I hope I made a game you enjoy playing as well.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Night Pond Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3770950","name":"Out On The Water"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808360/90feea9c110e6081debee3b919096cd94b92f011/header.jpg?t=1760291840","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended